<title>USA: Seaway Food Town sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Seaway Food Town sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>MAUMEE, Ohio 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seaway Food Town Inc said on Thursday that it declared a two-for-one stock split payable on May 7, 1997 to shareholders of record as of April 22, 1997.</p>
<p>Seaway said the company's improving earnings have been behind the increase in its share price and trading volume.</p>
<p>Seaway had approximately 2.2 million shares outstanding as of the end of its second quarter ended March 1, 1997.</p>
</text>
